# Workers AI (check-in parse): no API key env vars — the AI binding is configured in wrangler.jsonc.
# Local dev requires Cloudflare auth: run `wrangler login` so the remote AI binding works in `npm run dev`.

# AI PR review (packages/code-reviewer only — not used by the Astro app).
# Mint a Pro/team key at https://cursor.com/dashboard/integrations (free-plan keys get 403 on the Agent SDK).
#   export CURSOR_API_KEY=cursor_...
# In GitHub: repo Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → CURSOR_API_KEY
# CURSOR_API_KEY=